  "description": "<p>Damage multiplier for melee weapons (stab, slash). Default x10.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Install</strong><br />\nExtract zip content to root game folder</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Config</strong><br />\n.\\SPT\\user\\mods\\MeleeMultiplier\\Config\\MeleeMultiplierConfig.json5 change “meleeDamageMultiplier” value to any integer number</p>\n<pre><code>{\n  // damage multiplier x10 by default\n  \"meleeDamageMultiplier\": 10,\n \n  // List of item template IDs to exclude.\n  // https://db.sp-tarkov.com/search (root.item._id)\n  \"excludedMeleeItems\": [\n    \"6087e570b998180e9f76dc24\", // Tagillas Superfors DB 2020 Dead Blow Hammer\n    \"5fc64ea372b0dd78d51159dc\" // Сultist knife\n  ],\n}\n</code></pre>\n<hr />\n<p>Inspired by <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/819/deadly-blades\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/819/deadly-blades</a></p>\n",
